 CMake/CheckAtomic.cmake                    | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 CMakeLists.txt                             |  3 +++
 docs/build.md                              |  6 +++++
 ixwebsocket.pc.in                          |  1 +
 makefile.dev                               | 11 ++++++++
 test/cmake/atomic/CMakeLists.txt           | 12 +++++++++
 test/cmake/atomic/main.cpp                 | 14 ++++++++++
 8 files changed, 96 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .github/workflows/unittest_linux_32bit.yml
